  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The World Federation of Science Journalists (WFSJ) is a non-profit organization representing 41 associations of science and technology journalists and one associate partner from Africa, the Americas, the Asia-Pacific, Europe and the Middle East. It is, in short, an association of associations. The WFSJ seeks to further science journalism as a bridge between science, scientists and the public.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">World Federation of Science Journalists (WFSJ) &#xe4;r en ideell  organisation som samlar 41 sammanslutningar av journalister inom vetenskap och teknik i Afrika, Amerika, Asien -Stillahavsomr&#xe5;det, Europa och Mellan&#xf6;stern. WFSJ syftar till att st&#xe4;rka vetenskapsjournalistiken och bygga broar mellan vetenskap, forskare och allm&#xe4;nheten.</narrative>
  </description>
